 "title": "20 V, 3 A N-channel trench MOSFET in SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 4
 },
 "summary": "An N-channel enhancement MOSFET in the three-lead SOT-23, built on a trench process, rated 20 V drain to source and 3.0 A continuous drain current at 25 °C ambient (8.0 A pulsed). On-resistance is 45 mΩ typical, 55 mΩ maximum with 4.5 V on the gate, and 58 mΩ typical, 72 mΩ maximum with 2.5 V; the threshold lies between 0.55 V and 1.1 V. Gate-source voltage is limited to ±10 V. Uses named for it are battery-powered equipment, solid-state relays and switching driven straight from TTL or CMOS logic.",
 "key_figures": [
