   "text": "The SOT-23 body is moulded in a UL 94V-0 rated compound, is RoHS compliant and free of halogens. Leads carry a solder plating and meet the solderability test of MIL-STD-750, Method 2026."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Body diode",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The intrinsic body diode has its anode on the source and its cathode on the drain; its forward drop is at most 1.2 V at 2.5 A."
  }
